#: ../developer/accounting.md:1
msgid "Accounting Currency"
msgstr "记账币种"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:3
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps its ledger in USD unless an offline, audited migration "
"moves it to CNY. A CNY ledger counts model prices, charges and quotas in "
"CNY. The currency cannot change after the migration, and editing the site"
" configuration or restarting the gateway does not change it. A deployment"
" that never migrates keeps USD, and its API responses carry no currency "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"网关的账本默认使用 USD，只有经过一次离线、可审计的迁移才会改为 CNY。CNY 账本以 CNY "
"计算模型价格、费用和额度。迁移之后币种不能再改，编辑站点配置或重启网关也不会改变它。从未迁移的部署保持 USD，其 API 响应不含任何币种字段。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:5
msgid "How amounts are kept"
msgstr "金额如何保存"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:7
msgid ""
"`serving.accounting.AccountingPolicy` holds every rule that depends on "
"the currency. Code asks the policy instead of comparing currency codes."
msgstr "`serving.accounting.AccountingPolicy` 掌握所有与币种相关的规则。代码向这个策略查询，而不是自己比较币种代码。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "USD ledger (default)"
msgstr "USD 账本（默认）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "CNY ledger"
msgstr "CNY 账本"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Ledger columns"
msgstr "账本列"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the `*_usd` columns"
msgstr "`*_usd` 列"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the native `*_amount` columns (`NUMERIC(24, 12)`)"
msgstr "原币 `*_amount` 列（`NUMERIC(24, 12)`）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`*_usd` columns"
msgstr "`*_usd` 列"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the ledger itself"
msgstr "即账本本身"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid ""
"USD equivalents at the fixed rate, kept by the `accounting_sync_amounts` "
"triggers"
msgstr "按固定汇率折算的 USD 等值，由 `accounting_sync_amounts` 触发器维护"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Arithmetic of a charge, a gate and a reservation"
msgstr "费用、额度检查和预留的计算方式"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "binary floats"
msgstr "二进制浮点数"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "exact decimals of the configured prices"
msgstr "按所配置价格的精确十进制数计算"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "One counter or reservation increment rounds to"
msgstr "每次计数器或预留增量舍入到"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`0.000001` (half away from zero)"
msgstr "`0.000001`（四舍五入，远离零）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`0.000000000001` (half away from zero)"
msgstr "`0.000000000001`（四舍五入，远离零）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Request log `cost_usd`"
msgstr "请求日志 `cost_usd`"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`DECIMAL(12, 8)`"
msgstr "`DECIMAL(12, 8)`"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the USD equivalent of `cost_amount`"
msgstr "`cost_amount` 的美元等值"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Flat estimate, reservation ceiling, per-request ceiling"
msgstr "固定预估、预留上限、单次请求上限"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`0.01`, `5`, `1000` USD"
msgstr "`0.01`、`5`、`1000` USD"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the same USD constants at the fixed rate"
msgstr "相同的 USD 常量按固定汇率换算"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:18
msgid ""
"A request's cost is computed once, from its prices and usage, and rounded"
" only where it is counted, so sub-cent token prices add up exactly on a "
"CNY ledger. CNY amounts are never converted to USD and back; the `*_usd` "
"equivalents are derived one way, for USD contracts. The rate "
"(`usd_to_currency_rate`, CNY per USD) is fixed at migration time, with "
"the date and source the operator recorded. It is not a live exchange "
"rate, and recorded amounts are never re-read at another rate."
msgstr ""
"请求的费用根据价格和用量只计算一次，并且只在计入时舍入，因此在 CNY 账本上，低于一分的 token 单价也能精确累计。CNY 金额从不先换成 "
"USD 再换回来；`*_usd` 等值只单向推导，供 USD 约定使用。汇率（`usd_to_currency_rate`，每 USD 合多少 "
"CNY）在迁移时连同运维人员记录的日期和来源一起固定下来。它不是实时汇率，已记录的金额也绝不会按其他汇率重新读取。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:20
msgid "Model prices"
msgstr "模型价格"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:22
msgid ""
"`pricing_currency` (default `USD`) is the currency of a model's or "
"route's `pricing` and `pricing_schedule`. Token prices are per million "
"tokens, `request` per request and `image` per image. A price in the "
"ledger currency is charged as written, and a USD price on a CNY ledger is"
" converted at the fixed rate. Any other combination, such as a CNY price "
"on a USD ledger, is refused."
msgstr ""
"`pricing_currency`（默认 `USD`）是模型或路由的 `pricing` 和 `pricing_schedule` "
"所用的币种。token 价格按每百万 token 计，`request` 按每次请求计，`image` "
"按每张图片计。与账本币种相同的价格按原值计费，CNY 账本上的 USD 价格按固定汇率折算。其他任何组合（例如 USD 账本上的 CNY "
"价格）都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:24
msgid ""
"Automatic DeepSeek prices come from the [English pricing page](https"
"://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/) on a USD ledger and the "
"[Chinese pricing page](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-"
"cn/quick_start/pricing/) on a CNY ledger, never converted. A price "
"snapshot in another currency than the ledger's is refused. See [Automatic"
" DeepSeek prices](adding-models.md#automatic-deepseek-prices)."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek 自动价格在 USD 账本上取自[英文价格页](https://api-"
"docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/)，在 CNY 账本上取自[中文价格页](https://api-"
"docs.deepseek.com/zh-"
"cn/quick_start/pricing/)，从不换算。币种与账本不同的价格快照会被拒绝。参见[自动获取 DeepSeek 价格"
"](adding-models.md#automatic-deepseek-prices)。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:26
msgid "API contracts"
msgstr "API 约定"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:28
msgid "Every `*_usd` field means USD on every ledger."
msgstr "在任何账本上，每个 `*_usd` 字段都表示 USD。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:30
msgid ""
"USD ledger: responses have no `currency` field and no native amounts. A "
"budget refusal (429) adds `X-Accounting-Currency: USD` and `X-RateLimit-"
"Cost-Currency: USD`, which give the unit of the `X-RateLimit-*-Cost` "
"headers."
msgstr ""
"USD 账本：响应中没有 `currency` 字段，也没有原生金额。预算拒绝（429）会多带 `X-Accounting-Currency: "
"USD` 和 `X-RateLimit-Cost-Currency: USD` 两个响应头，说明 `X-RateLimit-*-Cost` "
"响应头的单位。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:31
msgid ""
"CNY ledger: responses add exact native amounts with `currency` beside "
"their USD fields (`cost`, `quota`, `spent`, `remaining`, `daily_limit`, "
"`budget_daily`, `usage_today` and the like), and the `*_usd` fields carry"
" USD equivalents. The model catalog adds `prices` and `currency`; its "
"`pricing` stays USD."
msgstr ""
"CNY 账本：响应在 USD 字段旁增加精确的原生金额和 "
"`currency`（`cost`、`quota`、`spent`、`remaining`、`daily_limit`、`budget_daily`、`usage_today`"
" 等），`*_usd` 字段则给出 USD 等值。模型目录增加 `prices` 和 `currency`；其 `pricing` 仍为 USD。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:32
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Writes: send a native amount with the ledger `currency`, for example "
"`{\"budget_daily\": \"50\", \"currency\": \"CNY\"}`. `budget_daily_usd` "
"still means USD. Another currency, or both a native amount and its USD "
"alias, is refused."
msgstr ""
"写入：发送原生金额时附上账本的 `currency`，例如 `{\"budget_daily\": \"50\", \"currency\": "
"\"CNY\"}`。`budget_daily_usd` 仍表示 USD。其他币种，或同时发送原生金额及其 USD 别名，都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:34
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These contracts stay USD on every ledger, so clients such as new-api, "
"one-api, sub2api and the cloud agent work unchanged: the OpenAI-"
"compatible billing endpoints (`/v1/usage`, `/v1/dashboard/billing/*`), "
"`/internal/agent-grants/{id}/usage` (`spent_usd`), batch `cost_usd`, "
"`upstream_cost_usd`, RouteWise budgets and diagnostics, and the "
"`X-RateLimit-*-Cost` headers. Provider balances keep their provider's "
"units."
msgstr ""
"以下约定在任何账本上都保持 USD，因此 new-api、one-api、sub2api 和云端 agent "
"等客户端无需改动即可继续使用：OpenAI "
"兼容的计费端点（`/v1/usage`、`/v1/dashboard/billing/*`）、`/internal/agent-"
"grants/{id}/usage`（`spent_usd`）、批次的 "
"`cost_usd`、`upstream_cost_usd`、RouteWise 预算与诊断，以及 `X-RateLimit-*-Cost` "
"响应头。provider 余额保持 provider 报告的单位。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:36
msgid ""
"The role default quotas (`user_daily_quota_<role>`) are stored in USD; on"
" a CNY ledger Admin shows and accepts them in CNY. `GET /site-config` "
"reports `accounting.currency`. The console shows the amounts the API "
"supplies and never converts or relabels them."
msgstr ""
"角色默认额度（`user_daily_quota_<role>`）以 USD 存储；在 CNY 账本上，Admin 以 CNY "
"显示和接受这些值。`GET /site-config` 报告 `accounting.currency`。控制台显示 API "
"提供的金额，从不自行换算或改标币种。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:38
msgid "Charging"
msgstr "计费"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:40
msgid ""
"Every request is charged at one billing point, in the ledger currency, "
"through one spend ledger: chat completions, Responses, Anthropic "
"`/v1/messages`, embeddings, the console playground, batches, inference "
"grants and requests made on behalf of another user. Admission checks the "
"API key's budgets, then its project's budgets, then the account's daily "
"and monthly quotas, and reserves an estimate between the flat minimum and"
" the reservation ceiling. The finished cost goes to the account, key and "
"project counters. A failed or cancelled request is charged what the "
"billing point recorded, or nothing if it produced no billable usage."
msgstr ""
"每个请求都在同一个计费点、以账本币种、通过同一个支出账本计费：Chat Completions、Responses、Anthropic "
"`/v1/messages`、Embeddings、控制台 Playground、批次、推理授权，以及代表其他用户发出的请求。准入时依次检查 "
"API "
"密钥的预算、其项目的预算、账户的每日和每月额度，并在固定预估下限与预留上限之间预留一笔估算费用。完成后的费用计入账户、密钥和项目计数器。失败或取消的请求按计费点记录的金额收费；没有产生可计费用量的则不收费。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Projects, multiple API keys and per-key budgets are described in the "
"design record {download}`2026-11-01-projects-and-api-keys-design.md "
"<../agents/specs/2026-11-01-projects-and-api-keys-design.md>`. [User tags"
"](user-tags.md) can lower an account's quotas further."
msgstr ""
"项目、多个 API 密钥和按密钥预算见设计记录 {download}`2026-11-01-projects-and-api-keys-"
"design.md <../agents/specs/2026-11-01-projects-and-api-keys-"
"design.md>`。[用户标签](user-tags.md)可以进一步降低账户的额度。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:44
msgid "Shared accounting"
msgstr "共享记账"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:46
msgid ""
"In shared mode, reservations and reconciliations are kept in "
"`spend_reservations.amount` and `spend_reconciliations.amount`, in the "
"ledger currency, with USD equivalents. A settlement's digest includes the"
" currency and the rate, and a crash reconciliation refuses log rows "
"charged in another currency (`metadata.spend_currency`)."
msgstr ""
"在共享模式下，预留和对账记录保存在 `spend_reservations.amount` 和 "
"`spend_reconciliations.amount` 中，使用账本币种，并附有 USD "
"等值。结算摘要包含币种和汇率；崩溃后的对账会拒绝以其他币种计费的日志行（`metadata.spend_currency`）。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:48
msgid ""
"Each process reports protocol `2`, its mode, currency and rate in its "
"`config_instances` capabilities. `python -m serving.shared_spend status` "
"lists a process with an older protocol, or another currency or rate, as "
"`unsupported` (and under `other_policy`); such a process must not join "
"the ledger. A process that holds a cost not known to be written cannot be"
" sealed for a handoff."
msgstr ""
"每个进程在其 `config_instances` 能力信息中报告协议 `2`、模式、币种和汇率。`python -m "
"serving.shared_spend status` 会把协议较旧、或币种或汇率不同的进程列为 `unsupported`（同时列在 "
"`other_policy` 下）；这样的进程不得加入该账本。仍持有一笔未确认已写入的费用的进程，不能为交接而封存。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:50
msgid "Migrating to CNY"
msgstr "迁移到 CNY"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:52
msgid ""
"`python -m migrations upgrade` applies `0022_ledger_currency`. It adds "
"the native columns, their triggers, the dashboard rollup's native sum and"
" the audit table, and converts nothing. The previous release keeps "
"running on it, and the database stays a USD ledger. A new CNY deployment "
"runs the steps below before it serves traffic."
msgstr ""
"`python -m migrations upgrade` 会应用 "
"`0022_ledger_currency`。它添加原生金额列及其触发器、仪表盘汇总的原生金额合计和审计表，不做任何换算。上一个版本可以继续在它上面运行，数据库仍是"
" USD 账本。新的 CNY 部署要在承接流量之前完成以下步骤。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:54
msgid ""
"`ops/accounting_currency.py` converts the ledger. It issues no DDL, and "
"it refuses `--apply` unless the schema is at this release's head, no "
"other client is connected, and shared accounting is in `local` mode with "
"no shared reservations, settlements or reconciliations. It needs a "
"positive `--usd-to-currency-rate`, an ISO `--rate-date` and a nonempty "
"`--rate-source`; it does not fetch a rate."
msgstr ""
"`ops/accounting_currency.py` 负责转换账本。它不执行 DDL，并且只有在以下条件都满足时才接受 "
"`--apply`：schema 处于本版本的最新修订，没有其他客户端连接，共享记账处于 `local` "
"模式且没有共享预留、结算或对账记录。它需要正数的 `--usd-to-currency-rate`、ISO 格式的 `--rate-date` "
"和非空的 `--rate-source`；它不会自行获取汇率。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:56
msgid ""
"Before the maintenance window, choose and record the rate, take a "
"database backup and test the restore, and keep the previous "
"configuration."
msgstr "在维护窗口之前：选定并记录汇率，备份数据库并测试恢复，保留之前的配置。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:57
msgid ""
"Stop incoming traffic and drain in-flight requests. Stop every gateway "
"worker, rollup, scheduled job, maintenance process, database console and "
"backup connection, and disable automatic restarts. The command terminates"
" no connection and cannot stop a scheduler from opening a new one."
msgstr ""
"停止接入流量并排空进行中的请求。停止所有网关 "
"worker、汇总任务、定时任务、维护进程、数据库控制台和备份连接，并关闭自动重启。该命令不会终止任何连接，也无法阻止调度器之后打开新连接。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:58
msgid "Preview, from the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录预览："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:68
msgid ""
"The preview is read-only. It shows both policies and, per monetary "
"column, the row counts, the USD total and the proposed native total. Logs"
" and their rollups describe overlapping usage, so reconcile each table on"
" its own."
msgstr "预览是只读的。它显示新旧两个策略，并针对每个金额列显示行数、USD 合计和拟转换的原生合计。日志与其汇总表描述的用量相互重叠，因此要逐表核对。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:69
msgid ""
"Run the same command with `--apply`. In one serializable transaction it "
"fills every native amount at the rate, records `accounting:policy` and "
"`accounting:migration` in `site_settings`, writes an audit row to "
"`accounting_currency_migrations`, and raises the compatibility floor to "
"`0022_ledger_currency`. Keep the JSON result and check that `applied` and"
" `migration_complete` are true. The `*_usd` values are not touched. "
"Running the same policy again returns `already_applied` and changes "
"nothing; any other policy, including another rate, is refused."
msgstr ""
"加上 `--apply` 再运行同一条命令。它在一个可串行化事务中按汇率填写所有原生金额，在 `site_settings` 中记录 "
"`accounting:policy` 和 `accounting:migration`，向 "
"`accounting_currency_migrations` 写入一行审计记录，并把兼容下限提升到 "
"`0022_ledger_currency`。保留输出的 JSON，确认 `applied` 和 `migration_complete` 为 "
"true。`*_usd` 值不会被修改。以同一策略再次运行会返回 `already_applied` "
"且不做任何改动；任何其他策略（包括不同的汇率）都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:70
msgid ""
"Before the gateway starts, declare the currency in `SITE_CONFIGURATION`, "
"for example with `python -m serving.config.manage set SITE_CONFIGURATION "
"'<json>'` in the backend image:"
msgstr ""
"在网关启动之前，在 `SITE_CONFIGURATION` 中声明币种，例如在后端镜像中运行 `python -m "
"serving.config.manage set SITE_CONFIGURATION '<json>'`："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:76
msgid ""
"Startup refuses a declaration that differs from the ledger (an absent one"
" means USD), an invalid policy, a CNY policy without its completion "
"marker, and a database missing the native columns, triggers or audit "
"table. Once the gateway runs, Admin refuses a currency change. The "
"declaration alone never migrates a database."
msgstr ""
"以下情况启动会被拒绝：声明与账本不一致（未声明即视为 USD）、策略无效、CNY "
"策略缺少对应的完成标记，以及数据库缺少原生金额列、触发器或审计表。网关运行后，Admin 会拒绝更改币种。仅修改声明从不会迁移数据库。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:77
msgid ""
"Before reopening traffic, check that `/site-config`, the catalog `prices`"
" and the usage and quota fields carry CNY, and check one controlled "
"request and one quota change against the ledger."
msgstr ""
"重新开放流量之前，确认 `/site-config`、目录中的 `prices` 以及用量和额度字段都是 "
"CNY，并用一个受控请求和一次额度修改对照账本核对。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:79
msgid "Compatibility and rollback"
msgstr "兼容性与回滚"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Database"
msgstr "数据库"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Images that start on it"
msgstr "可以在其上启动的镜像"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "USD, at `0022_ledger_currency`"
msgstr "USD，处于 `0022_ledger_currency`"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "this release and the previous one (the revision only expands the schema)"
msgstr "本版本和上一版本（该迁移只扩展库结构）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "CNY, migrated by `ops/accounting_currency.py`"
msgstr "CNY，已由 `ops/accounting_currency.py` 迁移"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid ""
"this release and later ones; older images refuse to start, because the "
"compatibility floor is `0022_ledger_currency`"
msgstr "本版本及之后的版本；更早的镜像会拒绝启动，因为兼容下限为 `0022_ledger_currency`"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:86
msgid ""
"Older images know only USD and would charge a CNY tariff as dollars, "
"which the floor prevents. A failed `--apply` rolls back its transaction: "
"keep services stopped, fix the cause and run it again with the same "
"inputs."
msgstr ""
"旧镜像只认识 USD，会把 CNY 价格当作美元计费，兼容下限阻止了这种情况。失败的 `--apply` "
"会回滚其事务：保持服务停止，修正原因后用相同的输入再次运行。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:88
msgid ""
"An applied CNY policy cannot be reversed or given another rate in place. "
"To go back, stop every client, restore the pre-migration backup and the "
"previous configuration, and account for the writes accepted after the "
"backup. Never imitate a rollback by editing the declaration or the policy"
" rows, or by applying an inverse rate. No schema downgrade is involved: "
"the downgrade of `0022_ledger_currency` keeps every column."
msgstr ""
"已应用的 CNY "
"策略不能原地撤销，也不能改用其他汇率。要退回，需停止所有客户端，恢复迁移前的备份和之前的配置，并处理备份之后接受的写入。切勿通过编辑声明或策略行、或应用反向汇率来模拟回滚。回滚不涉及"
" schema 降级：`0022_ledger_currency` 的降级会保留所有列。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:90
msgid "Databases built by a distribution"
msgstr "由发行版构建的数据库"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:92
msgid ""
"If a distribution's own revisions already created these objects, with the"
" same `accounting_sync_amounts` function, columns and triggers:"
msgstr "如果某个发行版自己的修订已经创建了这些对象，且 `accounting_sync_amounts` 函数、列和触发器都相同："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:94
msgid ""
"Keep its released revisions (files, ids and parents), so a database that "
"ran them never runs them again."
msgstr "保留它已发布的修订（文件、id 和父修订），使运行过它们的数据库不会再次运行。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:95
msgid ""
"Add one empty merge revision: `down_revision = (\"<distribution head>\", "
"\"0022_ledger_currency\")`."
msgstr ""
"添加一个空的合并修订：`down_revision = (\"<distribution head>\", "
"\"0022_ledger_currency\")`。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:96
msgid ""
"Upgrade. `0022_ledger_currency` checks the function digest "
"(`SYNC_FUNCTION_SHA256`), adds only what is missing, converts no amount, "
"and replaces only the `account_quotas` and `organizations` bridge "
"functions. It refuses a CNY database whose shared reservations or "
"reconciliations lack native amounts. It does not raise the compatibility "
"floor, so the distribution's previous image keeps starting."
msgstr ""
"升级。`0022_ledger_currency` "
"会校验函数摘要（`SYNC_FUNCTION_SHA256`），只添加缺失的部分，不换算任何金额，并且只替换 `account_quotas` 和"
" `organizations` 两个桥接函数。如果 CNY "
"数据库的共享预留或对账记录缺少原生金额，它会拒绝运行。它不会提升兼容下限，因此该发行版的上一个镜像仍可启动。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:97
msgid "Keep `accounting.currency` declared in `SITE_CONFIGURATION`."
msgstr "在 `SITE_CONFIGURATION` 中保留 `accounting.currency` 声明。"

